abstract: >-
  This repository contains the source code, automation scripts, data files,
  and analysis scripts developed for a master's thesis evaluating the
  performance of Wi-Fi 7 and Multi-Link Operation in IEEE 802.11be networks.
  The simulation framework is implemented using ns-3 and includes single-link,
  dual-link, multi-STA, multiband, traffic-steering, and robustness scenarios.
  The experiments generate CSV data and performance analyses based on
  throughput, delay, packet loss, jitter, and fairness metrics.
  The repository is provided to support reproducibility and further research.

